Description: terminal client for SvxLink reflectors
 A command-line client for SvxLink reflectors speaking protocol v3 — mutual
 TLS, AES-128-GCM encrypted Opus audio over UDP. Connect to a reflector,
 monitor several talkgroups at once, switch between them by priority or by
 hand, and transmit, all from a terminal or an SSH session.
 .
 Includes certificate enrolment (--enroll), an unattended --headless mode for
 nodes, and a control FIFO so a foot switch, a GPIO pin or a script can key the
 transmitter.
 .
 This package also provides the shared identity — one configuration file, one
 client certificate, one run lock — used by the SVXConnect desktop client.
